    "detailed_description": "<strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cooperative game for two players with simple asymmetrical gameplay.</li></ul></strong><br>One player plays with the keyboard only, while the other player uses only the mouse!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A gameplay at the service of the story.</strong></li></ul>Solve a series of crazy mini-games to advance the plot!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A crazy narrative adventure worthy of the biggest blockbusters.</strong></li></ul>So that fans of explosive experiences and crazy comedies can live a fantastic epic story together!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>You are the real actors!</strong></li></ul>Choose the emotion of the characters before each of their interventions, as you feel it!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A short experience to savor in one run.</strong></li></ul>Turn your movie/series night into a video game experience to enjoy with friends<br><br>Play the First CHAPTER for <strong>FREE</strong>!<br>Next chapters in DLC.<br><br><strong>There will be 5 chapters in total !</strong><br><br><strong>Plateform</strong> : PC Windows<br><br><strong>Number of players</strong> : 2 (local only - or Steam Remote Play)<br><br><strong>Controls </strong>:<br><br><strong>Player 1 </strong>: keyboard only<br><br><strong>Player 2 </strong>: mouse only<br><br><strong>Steam Remote Play compatible !!!</strong><br><br><strong>Language : French voices ! English subtitles</strong>",
